-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      NexClash differential verification against two whole machine-
              played recordings, both builds; simulated boot; boots to the
              title in OverSpec. Not on real hardware.

  Replay      IDENTICAL on two whole machine-played recordings (7 rooms), both
              builds: 40,378 frames, 81,604 adds, 27,012 plays, 56,199
              figures; 9 of 9 broken builds detected

  Emulator    OverSpec: the build boots to the game's title; play not driven
              there

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
